OL,3,APoundland's future hangs in the balance
OL,4,Aas chain edges towards collapse
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe future of Poundland hangs in the
OL,7,Fbalance as the discount chain edges
OL,8,Ftowards collapse, the BBC understands.
OL,10,FThe retailer's directors are filing a
OL,11,Fnotice of intention to appoint
OL,12,Fadministrators, which if approved by
OL,13,Fthe High Court, will give the business
OL,14,F10 days breathing space to find a
OL,15,Frescue deal.
OL,17,FPoundland's managing director Barry
OL,18,FWilliams wrote a memo to his 12,000
OL,19,Fstaff across its 600 stores in the UK
OL,20,Fand Ireland saying the US owner of the
OL,21,Fchain had limited Poundland's access to
OL,22,Ffunding.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,0,100
